{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>鄺港傑背景 姪仔姪女 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）2023年2月疑遭殺害 …</p><p></p>\n<p>鄺港傑背景 姪仔姪女  青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）2023年2月疑遭殺害，前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球及前夫兄長鄺港傑否認謀殺罪，案件踏入第33日審訊。鄺港傑首日出庭自辯，憶述得悉蔡天鳳腹中胎兒的經手人後大感驚訝。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%a6%aa%e5%85%84%e5%a6%b9-%e8%b5%b4%e7%be%8e%e5%8d%87%e5%ad%b8-%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e9%84%ba-2453477/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑身世學歷家庭背景 8字剖白與蔡天鳳關係 母親李瑞香職業首曝光</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港傑詢問1周後蔡天鳳才承認懷孕</h2>\n<p>據早前證供，蔡天鳳與鄺港智2013年結婚、2015年開始辦理離婚，直至2019年才正式完成手續，兩名子女撫養權歸蔡天鳳。庭上資料顯示，鄺港智於2015年6月離港前往海南島發展；翌年，鄺港傑留意到蔡天鳳身形出現變化，「肚腩越來越大」， 起初以為她懷有鄺港智的孩子，曾詢問蔡天鳳「係咪肥咗」，不過指蔡一周後才承認再度懷孕，不過BB生父並非胞弟鄺港智，「佢初頭冇答嘅，過咗一個禮拜左右啦，佢話佢有咗小朋友，我仲以為係細佬嘅添」。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e6%be%b3%e9%96%80%e8%b3%ad%e9%8c%a2-500%e8%90%ac%e8%b3%ad%e5%82%b5-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e7%84%a1%e8%a8%bb%e5%86%8a-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2443847/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜丈夫譚方駿與蔡天鳳無註冊原因  譚家被上門收數 譚父曾向鄺球求助</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港傑得悉蔡天鳳腹中胎兒生父感驚訝</h2>\n<p>鄺港傑詢問後約一星期後才得悉胎兒的父親是譚方駿。蔡天鳳曾向他介紹譚方駿Chris，自己只知道對方是蔡天鳳與鄺港智相識多年舊同學，而兩名年幼孩子亦稱譚方駿為「契爺」。他坦言一直不知道鄺港智與蔡天鳳已分手：「我唔覺得佢地分咗手，無人同我講過」，又表示得悉蔡天鳳懷有譚方駿孩子後感到驚訝，後來方知道母親李瑞香早數月已得悉懷孕消息。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%8b%9c%e8%a7%80%e9%9f%b3-%e7%b6%93%e6%96%87%e8%a1%a3%e7%b4%99-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%96-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86-2451997/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜龍尾村單位藏經文衣紙 主控問有否嬰兒出世獲5字回答 鄺球父子曾帶嬰兒浴盆入屋</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港智蔡天鳳共同撫養兩名子女</h2>\n<p>鄺港傑其後指鄺港智與蔡天鳳在2015年至2023年間共同出資撫養兩名子女，亦曾在香港炒賣名錶獲利，而他本人曾參與協助。兩名孩子期間先後居於黃埔花園、海逸豪園、維港星岸及加多利山，鄺港智則於2022年中搬回香港。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e4%bc%91%e5%ba%ad-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e7%89%a9%e6%a5%ad-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6-2445324/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳告知真相 譚方駿難過掩面 主控官提出休庭 鄺球於犯人欄疑哭泣</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港傑庭上罕談姪仔姪女 稱1點獲蔡天鳳欣賞</h2>\n<p>鄺港傑在庭上交代與蔡天鳳的關係時稱不想姪仔姪女缺乏父愛，「由於細佬唔喺到，我唔想小朋友好似無咗父愛咁」，因此自己特意花上絕大部分時間，代為照顧鄺港智與蔡天鳳所生的兩名子女，「都會去睇下佢哋返學放學生活點樣」。他指出，正因這段日子的付出，自己與蔡天鳳「建立咗屋企人嘅感情」；而蔡天鳳亦覺得他「好義務幫佢搞呢個屋企，咁佢都好appreciate（欣賞）我」。鄺港傑更以「感情好似親兄妹咁」，來形容二人當年親密無間的關係。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e7%bf%81%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%aa%8d%e7%bd%aa-%e5%9f%8b%e8%91%ac%e5%b1%8d%e9%ab%94-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2450408/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球開庭前突改口認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪 原因及背後部署盤算惹熱議</a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e5%90%88%e7%85%a7-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%a7%e4%bc%af-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e8%a6%aa%e5%af%86%e6%9c%8b%e5%8f%8b-2450674/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳鄺港傑多張合照庭上曝光 譚方駿首回應二人真實關係 警公開鄺最後接觸蔡衣服</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%90%8d%e9%8c%b6-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e4%ba%a4%e6%98%93-%e9%99%b3%e4%ba%ae%e6%81%92-damon-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-2447584/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜前妻遇害後 名錶職員揭鄺港智異常舉止 提出1大古怪要求：我照做</a></p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179143868559092020_21042266256ac72f5eef71b.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄺港傑 蔡天鳳 28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179143868559092020_21042266256ac72f5eef71b.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%8b%9c%e8%a7%80%e9%9f%b3-%e7%b6%93%e6%96%87%e8%a1%a3%e7%b4%99-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%96-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86-2451997/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜龍尾村單位藏經文衣紙 主控問有否嬰兒出世獲5字回答 鄺球父子曾帶嬰兒浴盆入屋</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e5%90%8d%e4%b8%8b-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-2442309/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜豪宅登記鄺球名下始末 豪宅出資人並非蔡天鳳 蔡母揭女兒收入來源：未婚前已有「億幾兩億」</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ba%ab%e4%b8%96-%e5%ae%b6%e5%ba%ad%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2440816/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜控方揭蔡天鳳身世學歷背景 買豪宅另有苦衷 母女訊息惹關注 拆解鄺家奪命計劃</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%ad%bb%e5%9b%a0-%e5%a5%b3%e6%b3%95%e9%86%ab%e9%83%ad%e5%98%89%e7%90%aa-%e9%a0%ad%e9%83%a8-%e5%a4%a7%e5%b0%8f%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2-%e7%a2%8e%e5%b1%8d-%e9%9d%92%e7%b4%85-2452341/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜女法醫親解蔡天鳳真正死因 生前頭部7次重擊 網民痛斥鄺家</a><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-%e5%a4%b1%e8%b9%a4-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e5%85%ac%e7%9c%be%e5%b8%ad%e7%ac%91-2442712/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><br/>\n</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e5%a7%91%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e5%88%a4%e6%b1%ba-%e5%85%92%e5%ad%90%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab-cctv-2451516/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜案發後鄺港智與母關鍵對話 李瑞香判決！法官：慈母多敗兒</a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e6%ad%a4%e6%83%85%e4%b8%8d%e5%86%8d-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92%e7%99%bc%e7%87%92-2446053/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿稱與鄺港智「此情不再」剖白關係變化內情 1事令關係逆轉：我打咗個突</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e5%85%a8%e5%ae%b6%e7%a7%bb%e8%8b%b1-%e7%a7%bb%e6%b0%91%e8%8b%b1%e5%9c%8b-%e9%84%ba%e8%ad%9a%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e9%84%ba-2445666/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿首披露帶妻及4子女全家移英計劃 蔡天鳳拒鄺譚子女同住原因</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab-%e6%be%b3%e6%b4%b2%e7%95%99%e5%ad%b8-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%b9%bc%e5%ad%90%e7%b9%bc%e5%a5%b3-2444979/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿出庭作供剖白與蔡天鳳相識經過 揭蔡11字回應鄺港智突失蹤7年</a>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/bb%e7%94%9f%e7%88%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">bb生父</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%87%b7%e5%ad%95/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">懷孕</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">譚方駿</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/2453599\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於SundayKiss</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b5%a1%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網絡熱話</a>\nNov 9 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.172753+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1674,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T07:38:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:56:23.342619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:32.333835+00:00","content_hash":"012d22096ef2ccebad16d93117ee07cd3b4c4c2fe8f7cdc1a258f5f73414f514","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}